{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU'RE NEXT!</h2>MK is back and better than ever in the next evolution of the iconic franchise.<br>  <br>The all new Custom Character Variations give you unprecedented control of your fighters to make them your own. The new graphics engine showcases every skull-shattering, eye-popping moment, bringing you so close to the fight you can feel it. Featuring a roster of new and returning Klassic Fighters, Mortal Kombat's best-in-class cinematic story mode continues the epic saga over 25\u00a0years in the making.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"6e76725f6471c0cb4ff55f0adaeae86746a10e91.jpg","localized_name":"Hit The Dojo","name":"Hit The Dojo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/976310/6e76725f6471c0cb4ff55f0adaeae86746a10e91.jpg"},{"icon":"f3c2708f6dc35b15086c6fefba4139610399806d.jpg","localized_name":"Ready To Kompete","name":"Ready To Kompete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/976310/f3c2708f6dc35b15086c6fefba4139610399806d.jpg"},{"icon":"b2be5bd54d453ca7f554a8fd172e33fb7a3488ca.jpg","localized_name":"No Bad Match Ups","name":"No Bad Match Ups","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/976310/b2be5bd54d453ca7f554a8fd172e33fb7a3488ca.jpg"},{"icon":"91e9243172bc4eb96d8fb35698a59a04565ab8e8.jpg","localized_name":"Blood In The Water","name":"Blood In The Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/976310/91e9243172bc4eb96d8fb35698a59a04565ab8e8.jpg"},{"icon":"c86f30f784a184e45c6b8958e316f1c64a9caa0a.jpg","localized_name":"Deadly Encounter","name":"Deadly Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/976310/c86f30f784a184e45c6b8958e316f1c64a9caa0a.jpg"},{"icon":"a465f3ae583acb6fe9656e5513f8f171034ec8fd.jpg","localized_name":"MURDER!!!","name":"MURDER!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app